                                            </div>
                                            <div class="ui-process-icons col-md-4 pl-0">
                                                <img src="~/images/work_process/discuss.svg" alt="discuss">
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="ui-process-steps box-7 animated fadeInRight">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="ui-process-icons col-md-4 pr-0">
                                                <img src="~/images/work_process/beta.svg" alt="beta version">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="ui-process-text col-md-8 px-0 align_rightSteps">
                                                <h4><span class="count-7">07.</span>Beta Release</h4>
                                                <p>Our foucs on beta testing is to reduce impact on users which often incorporates usability.</p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- second row section end -->
                                <!-- third row section begin -->
                                <div id="steps-row" class="third-row steps-pos-rel">
                                    <div class="ui-process-steps box-3 animated fadeInLeft">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="ui-process-text col-md-8 px-0 text-right align_leftSteps">
                                                <h4><span class="count-3">03.</span>Create Prototype</h4>
                                                <p>Our goal for prototyping is to create a model for our content and it's internal structrue.</p>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="ui-process-icons col-md-4 pl-0">
                                                <img src="~/images/work_process/Prototype.svg" alt="prototype">
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="ui-process-steps box-6 animated fadeInRight">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="ui-process-icons col-md-4 pr-0">
                                                <img src="~/images/work_process/testing.svg" alt="testing">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="ui-process-text col-md-8 px-0 align_rightSteps">
                                                <h4><span class="count-6">06.</span>Testing</h4>
                                                <p>Testing is performed with an intent to find whether the website has met the pre-defined goals.</p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- third row section end -->
                                <!-- fourth row section begin -->
                                <div id="steps-row" class="fourth-row steps-pos-rel">
                                    <div class="ui-process-steps box-4 animated fadeInLeft">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="ui-process-text col-md-8 px-0 text-right">
                                                <h4><span class="count-4">04.</span>Design</h4>
                                                <p>We design a website which appears professional and performs well.</p>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="ui-process-icons col-md-4 pl-0">
                                                <img src="~/images/work_process/design.svg" alt="design">
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="ui-process-steps box-5 animated fadeInRight">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="ui-process-icons col-md-4 pr-0">
